Berean Standard Bible (BSB) — Attribution & Licensing
======================================================

The Holy Bible, Berean Standard Bible, BSB is produced in cooperation with
Bible Hub, Discovery Bible, unfoldingWord, Bible Aquifer, OpenBible.com,
and the Berean Bible Translation Committee.

This text of God's Word has been dedicated to the public domain. Free
resources and databases are available at https://bereanbible.com/.

Source
------

The bsb.txt file in this directory is the official tab-separated plain-text
distribution downloaded from:

    https://bereanbible.com/bsb.txt

Format: one verse per line, two tab-separated columns:

    <Book Chapter:Verse>\t<English verse text>

The first three lines are header / license metadata and are skipped by the
parser.

Use
---

soap-journal bundles this text so the application works fully offline. The
parser at backend/soap_journal/parsers/bsb.py converts this source into the
canonical JSON schema defined in backend/soap_journal/parsers/schema.py;
the loader at backend/soap_journal/cli/load_translation.py ingests that
canonical JSON into the application database.
